---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — ToolXDev"
  description="ToolXDev privacy policy. We do not collect, transmit, or store your personal tool inputs or uploaded files."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">Effective Date: October 2026</p>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-200 pt-8">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">1. Client-Side Processing</h2>
        <p>
          ToolXDev is fundamentally designed around client-side execution. When using utilities like our Word Counter, JSON Formatter, or Image Compressor, your inputs (text, documents, code snippets, and pictures) remain solely within your device's browser memory. We do not transmit, log, or inspect your tool data.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">2. Analytics and Logging</h2>
        <p>
          We do not use invasive third-party behavioral trackers. Standard edge hosting metrics (such as aggregate page hits and error status codes) may be collected automatically by Cloudflare to ensure uptime and block automated DDoS attacks.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">3. Feedback Submissions</h2>
        <p>
          If you voluntarily provide feedback, bug reports, or feature requests via our contact form, that information is used solely by our maintainers to address your inquiry and is never shared or sold.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
